Z||000003||MinnGreenGT||09-06-2001||02:07 PM||||Zanio... First off, check with other people who have had their cars painted recently.  Most body shops do painting- or have someone specific who they send it to for paint. Otherwise you can check with your local generic chain-store  (ie: Maaco, Earl Schieb, etc...)<P>Next, check with a local paint and/or parts supplier.  Look for a PPG sticker and ask around for references!  Good Luck.<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grngtsig3.jpg"> <BR>Medium Metallic Green 87 GT<BR>3.1L High Output<BR>4 Spd OD Tranny<BR>Open (read: Loud) Exhaust<BR>and More!<BR>-Rob Bartlett||||reg||1
